# PAM configuration of SDE Screen Lock for unlocking with a fingerprint
# (docs/FINGERPRINT.md). The finger is checked by fprintd over D-Bus
# (net.reactivated.Fprint), next to the password, as pam_fprintd checks it;
# after a match SDE Screen Lock asks this service's account stack whether
# the account may still be used (an expired or locked account is not
# unlocked by a finger either). Nothing authenticates through this file:
# its auth stack refuses everything.
#
# To forbid unlocking the screen with a fingerprint on this computer,
# replace the account line with "account requisite pam_deny.so".
auth	requisite	pam_deny.so
@include common-account
